      "updated": 1762034818784,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "malloc()\n    - brk() of mmap() syscall\n    - brk() controls the heap\n    - mmap() control dedicated\n    - only call brk() when needed,\n    no need to do it every time; does\npre-allocation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "malloc()\n    - brk() of mmap() syscall\n    - brk() controls the heap\n    - mmap() control dedicated\n    - only call brk() when needed,\n    no need to do it every time; does\npre-allocation",
